473392025_570326435364252_1671269543686935979_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I19AKuOtSREQ7kNvwGAPFYB&_nc_oc=AdoQEheNwqTJ0jNERsfr7uJYsUYy9r6OiBzBW0iDi2BvMUYU9tdMz7GQLvCdjoXuDRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOtZsU8Uw_9Q6iyHlTXFNMsuYXza7ITKBSiiZgHWmN3eQ&oe=6AE5EA97"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "646026574804312", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_646026578137645_9023846448384584760_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4FlvMFkJvBUQ7kNvwFI8tLL&_nc_oc=AdokL8OqeXoK0o3raY4XcR-49K01oANptB0gZb1x1FWjX2HqajVf_-lnTkl8Qz2fNrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIaZFmQd4RaiCTDEpM6WL_IxhsoxxBJzhL8t2qTNVIZQ&oe=6AE5F7AA"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1400275601117059", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1400275604450392_6111570253860139230_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fe3YnyiNtC4Q7kNvwHHRaer&_nc_oc=AdoWT0AYXyZ2tlWWjsEU8ESh3WycRZvgzR3AbXH87sx1lF92XsuZWTdCC4G3NBbSxsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9fNzYOp1ydD20La7b2yIrYTZqlTSFwocAI7cRZJlcdQ&oe=6AE612CD"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2455081078173099", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2455081081506432_2090184349680392773_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=01cPndxuKOwQ7kNvwEOLEFb&_nc_oc=AdqeWrv1vTtzu6iemHnmBN6kwfLXphnn7qY4-s2FkjyPtBIGT_60ZgLOw3EbFV9HdNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNWo1_KWu24kZX9jDHqX9VmHOEL0KXOqUUsD-XwHWZ7uw&oe=6AE5E64D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "528339819997704", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392309_528339823331037_367341527598948289_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ytq2Mhix5hEQ7kNvwEAg7CB&_nc_oc=AdqeXwpF8oTC8RGAFpvhY4Ag2hHcAl2ETvpAQdAgzjvCn5V6-vNisEm1gvz6rv8vfd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMd1HAFQz8AoeUwp_-yXalFlvb-Cib3MeOSROpk-u5h0w&oe=6AE60452"}, "display_name": "Punch Beat Arena", "keywords": ["Game", "Rhythm", "Music", "Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# **\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6**\n\nStep into Punch Beat Arena, a high-energy VR boxing game that blends rhythm-based gameplay with fierce action. Get ready to fight to the beat as you throw punches, dodge, and weave to the music in a world where your reflexes and rhythm define your success.\n\n{1070244414940312}\n\n# **Key Features:**\n\n- Rhythm-Driven Boxing: Strike, block, and move in sync with the music. Every action you take is influenced by the beat, offering an exhilarating challenge that combines skill and timing.\n\n- Wide Selection of Tracks & Arenas: Pick from a diverse array of tracks across various genres. Each song brings its own set of challenges and arenas, tailored for both beginners and advanced players.\n\n- Fitness Meets Fun: Punching to the beat isn't just about fun\u2014it's a full-body workout! Sharpen your reflexes and burn calories while enjoying the excitement of the game.\n\n- Immersive Experience: With stunning visuals and high-quality sound design, every round feels like you're truly in the ring, feeling the music pump you up as you fight.\n\n{1030845768901015}\n\nGear up, find your rhythm, and punch your way to victory in Punch Beat Arena, where every beat is a new challenge to conquer!", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6\n\nExperience the ultimate VR rhythm boxing game where every punch and move is synced to the beat. Fight, dodge, and punch to a variety of tracks in immersive arenas. A fun, full-body workout that combines music, action, and fitness in one exciting experience!\nLet's Play !!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Totos